WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.740 --> 00:00:06.819
Hey, David, when it comes to Corona virus,
are we the only country smearing doctors who

00:00:06.819 --> 00:00:09.019
are trying to save lives like.

00:00:09.019 --> 00:00:12.450
Dr. Anthony Foushee, it's a good question.

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:19.120
Anthony Foushee has been smeared widely by
the Corona virus protesters who have been

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:21.720
saying for more than a month now we've got
to open it up.

00:00:21.720 --> 00:00:23.390
We never should've closed it down.

00:00:23.390 --> 00:00:28.029
We saw chance of fire foushee at a number
of different protests.

00:00:28.029 --> 00:00:33.270
We more recently I covered this earlier in
the week, we saw signs that say Hang Foushee

00:00:33.270 --> 00:00:36.060
and hang Belak, Bill Gates as well.

00:00:36.060 --> 00:00:42.860
But the truth is that we are not the only
country where doctors have been targeted.

00:00:42.860 --> 00:00:46.690
The thing is, in most of the other places
where we see it, the doctors are being targeted

00:00:46.690 --> 00:00:49.390
by the state, not by random protesters.

00:00:49.390 --> 00:00:50.730
So I'll give you some examples.

00:00:50.730 --> 00:00:56.070
We know that early, very early in the Corona
virus outbreak in China, there were doctors

00:00:56.070 --> 00:01:01.540
who were starting to see the spread of Corona
virus and they were talking about it.

00:01:01.540 --> 00:01:07.700
And we have a number of reports that law enforcement
authorities showed up at the homes of some

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:11.140
of these Chinese doctors and said, you've
got to stop talking about this.

00:01:11.140 --> 00:01:17.600
You can't keep talking about this spreading
virus, which at the time we knew very little

00:01:17.600 --> 00:01:19.600
about and had hadn't really identified.

00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:21.200
This was in late twenty nineteen.

00:01:21.200 --> 00:01:25.049
So certainly we've seen antagonism of doctors
in China.

00:01:25.049 --> 00:01:27.130
The difference is it's not coming from random
protesters.

00:01:27.130 --> 00:01:29.960
It's not coming from media in the same way.

00:01:29.960 --> 00:01:31.249
Maybe state media.

00:01:31.249 --> 00:01:35.530
But we did see law enforcement antagonize
doctors in Russia.

00:01:35.530 --> 00:01:42.390
We have a number of reports of doctors who
were working on Corona virus and speaking

00:01:42.390 --> 00:01:46.170
about coronavirus who fell out of windows.

00:01:46.170 --> 00:01:49.960
Now, I don't want to say more than what we
know.

00:01:49.960 --> 00:01:51.329
It sounds weird to me.

00:01:51.329 --> 00:01:55.380
It's like those stories of, hey, someone fell
on a knife 10 times.

00:01:55.380 --> 00:01:56.380
OK.

00:01:56.380 --> 00:01:59.159
Well, what do you mean they fell on a knife
10 times?

00:01:59.159 --> 00:02:04.560
There are reports of multiple Russian doctors
that were making public statements about coronavirus

00:02:04.560 --> 00:02:07.740
who fell out of windows and died.

00:02:07.740 --> 00:02:10.430
I'm not going to say anymore because we don't
know anymore.

00:02:10.430 --> 00:02:20.720
But my point is, I am not aware of the loud
public campaigns against doctors who know

00:02:20.720 --> 00:02:23.860
about infectious disease in other countries.

00:02:23.860 --> 00:02:32.520
But we do know, I guess we could call it hostility,
hostility towards the medical community from

00:02:32.520 --> 00:02:33.970
some state governments.

00:02:33.970 --> 00:02:36.550
And there's probably more examples that I
haven't mentioned.

00:02:36.550 --> 00:02:42.330
But an important question and I mean, listen,
anti-vax exists in a lot of the world.

00:02:42.330 --> 00:02:46.290
There isn't you know, when we started seeing
the measles outbreaks as a result of communities

00:02:46.290 --> 00:02:49.170
that didn't want to vaccinate, it wasn't just
the United States.

00:02:49.170 --> 00:02:50.550
We have a lot of them in the United States.

00:02:50.550 --> 00:02:52.490
It wasn't just the United States.

00:02:52.490 --> 00:02:56.100
When we look at protests to reopen.

00:02:56.100 --> 00:02:59.120
It's not just the United States.

00:02:59.120 --> 00:03:04.260
We saw them in isolated spots around the world,
but it's mostly in the United States that

00:03:04.260 --> 00:03:06.140
we have this phenomenon.

00:03:06.140 --> 00:03:10.340
And I don't know, you know, we can make a
lot of broad claims about what it says about

00:03:10.340 --> 00:03:14.730
society or we have the most stupid people,
we have the most stagnant, but whatever.

00:03:14.730 --> 00:03:17.260
We also have some of the smartest people and
a lot of them.

00:03:17.260 --> 00:03:18.380
A lot of them.

00:03:18.380 --> 00:03:25.960
But there is something cultural here where
these ideas get a life of their own.

00:03:25.960 --> 00:03:28.500
Media will often give them oxygen.

00:03:28.500 --> 00:03:30.750
And it's definitely very, very bad here.

00:03:30.750 --> 00:03:31.590
No question about it.

